OL,3,GNEWSACelebrating 60 years of Notting
OL,4,AHill Carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs I walk into the heart of the 60th
OL,7,FNotting Hill Carnival, the sun is
OL,8,Fshining and bouncing off the sequins,
OL,9,Fgems and sparkles of the costumes and
OL,10,Fdecorations surrounding me.
OL,12,FFlags from all over the Caribbean and
OL,13,FAfrica have been hung from the windows
OL,14,Fof the houses and are draped over the
OL,15,Fshoulders of people passing by.
OL,17,FEveryone is dressed for sunshine,
OL,18,Fdespite the rain that was forecast. It
OL,19,Fseems the spirit of Carnival has seen
OL,20,Foff those dark clouds.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
