OL,3,GNEWSACelebrating 60 years of Notting
OL,4,AHill Carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sunday parade hasn't started yet,
OL,7,Fbut the music is already pumping, and
OL,8,Fplenty of people are dancing, already
OL,9,Fcovered in paint from J'ouvert, the
OL,10,Ftraditional early-morning celebration
OL,11,Fwhich kicks off Sunday's festivities.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
